RANK V GIVES EACH VALUE ITS PLACE IN ASCENDING ORDER, 1 FOR
THE LEAST. VALUES THAT TIE SHARE THE MEAN OF THE PLACES THEY
WOULD HAVE TAKEN, SO THE RANKS STILL SUM TO 1+2+...+N.

